<title>POLAND: NOVITA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.54 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.84 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.17 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Sales		    6.21 vs   5.24</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.92 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.17 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.42 vs   2.22</p>
<p> Sales		   37.36 vs  32.77</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish carpet maker is Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
